{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3480","id":4522788172,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz888AAAABDZRFTA","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3480","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3480.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3480.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3480","number":3480,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"db: return non-NotFound errors from user lookups","user":{"login":"iSerganov","id":41109559,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMTA5NTU5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41109559?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov","html_url":"https://github.com/iSerganov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSerganov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`GetUserByID` and `GetUserByOIDCIdentifier` only tested the query result for `gorm.ErrRecordNotFound` and then returned &user unconditionally. Any other failure - a closed connection, a scan error, a cancelled query - fell through and returned a zero-valued types.User with a nil error.\r\n\r\n`CreatePreAuthKey` consumes `GetUserByID` directly and would mint a key with `user_id = 0` from such a result. The foreign key constraint catches that today, so the symptom is a constraint violation that points nowhere near the failed read.\r\n\r\nCollapse both lookups onto a single helper that maps a missing row to `ErrUserNotFound` and **returns every other error** unchanged.\r\n","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:47Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T13:24:58Z","closed_at":"2026-09-23T13:24:58Z","merged_at":"2026-09-23T13:24:58Z","merge_commit_sha":"0661c6f540aa507c28d44cc9b0e287805b99c789","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"juanfont","id":181059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTA1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3480/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3480/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3480/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/statuses/fb1a2a8f1a38b5373cfdceb5ab1fff8d85c63171","head":{"label":"iSerganov:main","ref":"main","sha":"fb1a2a8f1a38b5373cfdceb5ab1fff8d85c63171","user":{"login":"iSerganov","id":41109559,"node_id":"MDQ6VXN